### CeyGreen E-Commerce Marketplace API samples
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@service = http://localhost:8084
@apiKey = ceygreen-dev-api-key

### Register/login via gateway first (Student 2 user service), then set:
# @farmerToken = <farmer-jwt>
# @buyerToken = <buyer-jwt>
# @farmerId = <uuid>
# @buyerId = <uuid>

### List active products (direct service)
GET {{service}}/products
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Filter products
GET {{service}}/products?cropName=Tomato&location=Kandy
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Create listing (farmer) — via gateway
POST {{gateway}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cropName": "Tomato",
  "quantity": 20,
  "unitPrice": 150.00,
  "harvestDate": "2026-08-09",
  "location": "Kandy"
}

### Create listing (direct service, manual headers)
POST {{service}}/products
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-User-Role: FARMER
X-Farmer-Id: {{farmerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cropName": "Beans",
  "quantity": 12,
  "unitPrice": 90.00,
  "harvestDate": "2026-08-09",
  "location": "Galle"
}

### Update listing / deactivate
PUT {{service}}/products/1
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-User-Role: FARMER
X-Farmer-Id: {{farmerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 25,
  "active": true
}

### Checkout (buyer)
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}